    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/41930dceed63b5c44f82fc6abe4d5528.avif?t=1754507476\" width=748 height=896 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Nikki\u2026 Nikki, damn it\u2026 can you hear me? Wake up\u2026 please\u2026&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Nairhad \u2014 the sunken city that never stopped breathing.\u00a0</strong>IT BEGAN is a single-player tactical horror shooter set in the drowned ruins of a forgotten metropolis.<br>You awaken in silence, alone\u2026 but never truly alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the cult that worships the abyss.<br>Fight twisted creatures born in salt and madness.<br>And uncover the fragmented memories of a man who may no longer be himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corridor is a secret.<br>Every shadow is a whisper.<br>And something \u2014 something beneath the water \u2014 is waiting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/fa94840b16471b8da1a6b47d842b208e.avif?t=1754507476\" data-has-big width=1600 height=146 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The city sleeps\u2026 but the water remembers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nairhad isn\u2019t just a location \u2014 it\u2019s a living tomb.<br>You\u2019ll walk through flooded corridors, derelict chambers, and crumbling monuments of a civilization that tried to forget itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light is rare. Oxygen is precious. And silence is never complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner holds a secret.<br>Every step pulls you deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e6eddb0a3c4a2bf150c6d7355c1808cb.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8195dc4413fb8bbee070726e9a6c1f50.avif?t=1754507476\" data-has-big width=1600 height=114 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Violence is not always the answer. But silence\u2026 often is.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use darkness to your advantage. Lure enemies into traps. Disable lights. Distract with noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/2bca596b9533132b12cb2a324c5ff038.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IT BEGAN rewards patience, precision, and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not a soldier. You are the only one left who can disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/8fbcd409eee199bf977a2e32057a48c7.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/3b649fe8310c8f8c26f28e6a2fb17dc2.avif?t=1754507476\" data-has-big width=1600 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Who were you before Nairhad took you in?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the ruins, echoes of your past surface through broken machinery, scattered notes, and hallucinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories twist. Reality bends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth isn\u2019t waiting to be found \u2014 it\u2019s waiting to be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/a93faded44250b3af1b65e93f3f95ff7.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/63973783656e59247a5f252aef815967.avif?t=1754507476\" data-has-big width=1600 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You were never meant to return. But the cult remembers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fanatics lurk in the deep, protecting something ancient.<br>Creatures shift in the shadows \u2014 born not of flesh, but of water, bone, and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy has a purpose. Every encounter, a cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are waiting to kill you.<br>Others\u2026 to wake you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/dda1d24c16b332d1664ffafcdb2746dc.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just survive and find answers in this world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e4c2916b054ec46119959058733d12ec.poster.avif?t=1754507476\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e4c2916b054ec46119959058733d12ec.webm?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735270/extras/e4c2916b054ec46119959058733d12ec.mp4?t=1754507476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
